# DataFix Frontend Environment Configuration
# Reference: docs/architecture.md and AGENTS.md

# =============================================================================
# Local Development:
# Set this to your local FastAPI backend port (normally http://127.0.0.1:8000)
# =============================================================================
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# =============================================================================
# Production (Vercel):
# In Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables, configure:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://datafix-backend.onrender.com
# (matching your deployed Render backend URL)
#
# IMPORTANT SECURITY RULES:
# 1. Never put GROQ_API_KEY, Supabase service keys, or secrets in this file.
# 2. Never prefix secret credentials with VITE_.
# 3. All LLM and database credentials belong exclusively in Render / backend/.env.
# =============================================================================
